*** Settings ***
Documentation     [SUITE PURPOSE]
...    This suite tests the scenario where beamforming is disabled and the path max
...    queueing delay is not exceeded or is exceeded. It uses a configuration with 6 cells, 3CC CA and 3 UEs.
...    The test is performed on a 5G TDD RAN with a SANSA FS CPRI CMWV FDD+ECPRI CMWV TDD AZQJ variant.

Force Tags    CONFIGURED    CRT    PY39    RAN_5G    RAN_5G_TDD    SBTS00
    ...    CLOUD_5G_I_LO_AP_LO
    ...    VARIANT_SANSA_FS_CPRI_CMWV_FDD+ECPRI_CMWV_TDD_AZQJ

Library    taf.ul.hanging_resources.listener    ${False}
Resource   ./resources/5GC002640_resources.robot
Library    ute_wtssim

Suite Setup    Run keywords    Prepare suite environment  egate_config=${lua_cfg_file}  rad_params=@{SWCONFIG_FLAGS_LIST}
...                            ap_xml=${ap_xml}  scfc=${scfc}
...            AND  Create aliases
...            AND  Setup eNB Fsm Access  alias=gNB2

*** Variables ***
${lua_cfg_file}=  ${CFG_DIR}/egate_config_FDD_TDD_6Cells_SANSA_3CC_CA_3UEs.cfg
${ap_xml}=        ${CFG_DIR}/GNB_LO_AP_LO_FDD_TDD_1AEQE_6Cells_FS_SANSA_3CC_CA/iphy_AHLOA_AHCA_AHFIB_AEQE_6Cells.xml
${scfc}=          ${CFG_DIR}/GNB_LO_AP_LO_FDD_TDD_1AEQE_6Cells_FS_SANSA_3CC_CA/SCFC_FDD_TDD_6Cells_FS_SANSA_3CC_CA_FFT.xml
${counters}       M55316C03002, M55316C05002

*** Test Cases ***
5GC002640-AA-B5a_Beamforming_disabled_with_path_max_queueing_delay_not_exceeded
  [Documentation]
  ...  1.DESCRIPTION
  ...   This user scenario describes successful call setup with FDD – TDD FR1 DL CA for the single UE with dynamic flow control,
  ...   data split over PCell and SCells, with blind SCells addition and blind SCells activation. Beamforming on TDD FR1 SCells is disabled.
  ...
  ...  2.TEST ENVIRONMENT AND SETTINGS
  ...   This item is testing in UTE environment:
  ...       -5G Classical SA CMWV L1Bypass cloud test line (CLOUD_5G_I_BOO_AP_KLLL_SANSA_L1B_ECPRI_CMWV_TDD) gNB (ASIB, 2xABIO, AMIA),
  ...        UE simulator (Airphone ASIK + 3xABIL), WTS 5G core simulator (Egate)
  ...       -gNB has configured 3CC for Carrier Aggregation: 1 Cell FDD and 2 Cells TDD (CA relations created)
  ...       -simulated Radio (AHLOA, AHFIB, AEQE, AHCA)
  ...   Used HW: gNB (ASIB, 2xABIO, AMIA), UE simulator (Airphone ASIK + 3xABIL)
  ...   Simulated RRH (AHLOA) – gNB ABIO-1 RF1, AP ABIL-1: Cell-1 – FDD FR1 10MHz ( band n71 )
  ...   Simulated RRH (AHFIB) – gNB ABIO-1 RF7, AP ABIL-2: Cell-2 – FDD FR1 10MHz ( band n66 ), Cell-5 – FDD FR1 10MHz ( band n25 )
  ...   Simulated RRH (AEQE) – gNB ABIO-2 RF1, AP ABIL-3: Cell-3 – TDD FR1 60MHz ( band n41 ), Cell-6 – TDD FR1 60MHz ( band n77 )
  ...   Simulated RRH (AHCA) – gNB ABIO-1 RF2, AP ABIL-1: Cell-4 – FDD FR1 10MHz ( band n5
  ...   Both TDD Cells are configured on the same RU so they are mapped to the same L2-RT instance!
  ...
  ...  2.1 Testing Tools
  ...       gNB: Nokia 5G BTS
  ...       Airphone (AP) – UEs simulator
  ...       WTS – ePC simulator - 5G core network simulator
  ...       Tcpdump & Wireshark – tools for capturing messages
  ...       BTSLog (cli) for collecting gNB & AP remote syslog
  ...       Robot Framework and Python runtime environment to automate the testing process
  ...       Web Element Manager
  ...
  ...  2.2 Test Automation
  ...   Automation in robotframework
  ...
  ...  3. DEFINITIONS FROM THE TEST SET
  ...   Test case covers: 5G_RAN_UP_44604, 5G_RAN_UP_43838, 5G_RAN_UP_44479
  ...
  ...  3.1 Definitions from the Test Plan
  ...
  ...  3.2 Required Logs
  ...       Wireshark/TCPdump Logs (NGAP, NR-RRC, E1AP, F1AP)
  ...       TTI Trace
  ...       Counters
  ...       Default gNB & AP SysLog
  ...       BTS Snapshot
  ...       BIP logs
  ...       Sherpa Trace
  ...
  ...  4. TESTING INSTRUCTIONS
  ...  4.1 Preconditions
  ...    gNB configuration:
  ...    - New L2RT architecture (CB007736) is enabled:
  ...        NRBTS/NRDU.flexibleCAMode = 2 (ConfigurationIndependent)
  ...    - Mobility support for mixed carrier aggregation (CB008015) is enabled:
  ...        NRBTS/NRDU.actConnectedModeMobilityCA = True
  ...    - All FDD cells are configured to allow SA access:
  ...        MRBTS/NRBTS/gNbCuType = SA+NSA
  ...        Each FDD Cell has configured MRBTS/NRBTS/NRCELL.cellDepType = SA
  ...    - Inter-band FDD + TDD FR1 DL CA feature (5GC002640) is activated and legacy CA features are activated too:
  ...        NRBTS/NRDU.carrierAggregationSupportList contains elements equal to 600 (ca_Fdd_Any_Sa), 200 (ca_Fdd_Fr1Tdd_Sa) and 3 (ca_Fdd_Fdd)
  ...    - CA relations are configured for each FDD cell by NRRELs pointing to:
  ...        1 FDD Cell: Cell-2 and TDD Cell: Cell-6
  ...    - SCell addition method is set to blind:
  ...        each NRREL object NRBTS/NRCELL/NRREL.sCellAdditionMethod parameter is set to 0 (blind)
  ...    - SCell activation method is set to blind:
  ...        NRBTS.sCellActivationMethod = 0 (blind)
  ...    - DRX is disabled in both FDD and TDD FR1 Cells:
  ...        NRBTS/NRCELL.actCDrx = False
  ...    - DSS features are disabled in FDD Cells:
  ...        NRBTS.actLteNrDss = False
  ...    - Aperiodic CSI is disabled in all Cells:
  ...        NRBTS.NRCELL.actAperCsi = False
  ...    - TDD Cells are configured with subframe configuration according to 5GC001116-B (TD LTE config 2 SSF6 starting from SFN 0):
  ...        frameStructureType = tdLte
  ...        guardPeriodLength = 6 symbols (SSF6)
  ...        lteToNrFrameShift = 0ms
  ...        prachConfiguration = 97 (format A2 in subframe 7)
  ...        ssBurstSetPeriod = 20ms
  ...    - TDD Cells are configured without beamforming:
  ...        NRBTS/NRCELL.actBeamforming = False
  ...    - TDD Cells are configured without 5GC002200:
  ...        NRBTS/NRCELL.dlMimoMode = 2x2 Open Loop Spatial Multiplexing
  ...    - Cell 1 has NRRELs, with sCellAdditionMethod set as blind, that point to
  ...        Cell 2: FDD (e.g. band 66),
  ...        Cell 3: TDD (e.g. band 41, choose one NRARFCN)
  ...        Cell 6: TDD (e.g. band 41, different non-contiguous NRARFCN with Cell 3)
  ...    - Cell 1, Cell 2 and Cell 6 are activated and on-air. Cell 3 is inactive.
  ...    - Long PUCCH is enabled:
  ...        NRBTS/NRCELL.pucchModeSelect = longPucch
  ...    - FDM scheduling is enabled:
  ...        NRBTS/actFdmScheduling = True
  ...        NRBTS/NRCELL.actIncreasedFdmUsersPerSlot = True
  ...    - NR-UE1 supports FDD-TDD 3CC CA with band combinations:
  ...        * CA_n66A-n71A-n77A (FDD n71 + FDD n66 + TDD n77),
  ...        * CA_n41A-n71A-n77A (FDD n71 + TDD n41 + TDD n77),
  ...        * CA_n41(2A)-n71A   (FDD n71 + TDD n41 + TDD n41),
  ...        * CA_n41C-n71A      (FDD n71 + TDD n41 + TDD n41)
  ...    - NRBTS/NRCELL/primaryPathMaxQueueingDelay = 10ms
  ...    - NRBTS/NRCELL/secondaryPathMaxQueueingDelay = 10ms
  ...
  ...  4.2 Test Steps
  ...    Step 1: Blind SCells activation
  ...    Step 2: NonGBR Data transmission in both directions
  ...  4.3 Postconditions
  ...   UE is configured with 3CC, all SCells remain active
  ...   UE performs periodic CSI Measurements on all carriers: PCell and SCells
  ...   gNB accepts CSI measurements via dedicated PUCCH Format3 resource from PCell and all SCell(s) on FDD PCell from the UE
  ...   The corresponding counters for SCell activation are updated accordingly
  ...       -PSCELL_UE_2_ACT_SCELL_DL
  ...       -MAX_PSCELL_UE_2_ACT_SCELL_DL
  ...
  ...  5.REFERENCES
  ...   [1] CFAM for 5GC002640 - https://gates.nsn-net.net/view/00024a24#o=0
  ...
  ...  6.HISTORY
  ...   v0.1 2021.07.23 Jakub Drabina – test case draft
  ...   v0.2 2021.09.16 Lukasz Gdowski – test case update, adjustment to new template
  ...   v0.3 2021.10.15 Lukasz Gdowski - test case update
  ...   v0.4 2021.10.19 Lukasz Gdowski – remove default MCS verification
  ...   v0.5 2021.11.04 Jakub Drabina – change traffic values to max possible on L1Bypass
  ...   v1.0 2021.11.09 Lukasz Gdowski - review done: https://collab.ext.net.nokia.com/ui#review:id=844428

    Log to console  Start Test Case  5GC002640-AA-B5a_Beamforming_disabled_with_path_max_queueing_delay_not_exceeded
    Register 3CC CA capable NR-UE1 to gNB-2 Cell-1
    Establish PDU session for NR-UE1 and wait for SCells blind activation

    Start SA traffic  ue=1  dir=dl  traffic_rate=350Mbps
    Start SA traffic  ue=1  dir=ul  traffic_rate=10Mbps
    Wait 30s for throughput stable

    Verify SA traffic  ue=1  dir=dl  expected_traffic=350Mbps
    Verify if dl transmission is done via SCells 0,1,2

    Trigger DL BLER Test Mode to achieve Target MCS
    Collect TTI Traces during 2 seconds and save to directory 3CC_blind_act_tput

    Verify if UL transmission is done via PCell only
    Verify if MCS calculation is applied
    Verify if Ue performs csi measurement reports on all carriers  phys_cells_ids=50,51,55
    Verify If Csi Measurement Reports Are Done Via Dedicated Pucch Format3  pcell=50  scells=51,55
    Verify if that counters PSCELL_UE_2_ACT_SCELL_DL, MAX_PSCELL_UE_2_ACT_SCELL_DL are updated accordingly

    ${pm_counter_file}=    Get Latest Unpacked Full Pm Counters File
    Get counters value and report to rp  counters=${counters}  filepath=${pm_counter_file}  localmoid=NRCELL-1

    [Teardown]  Run keywords
    ...         Produce Scout Data                       AND
    ...         Deactivate and remove UE bler testmodes  AND
    ...         Stop SA traffic  ue=1                    AND
    ...         Release PDU session for NR-UE1           AND
    ...         Deregister NR-UE1

5GC002640-AA-B5b_Beamforming_disabled_with_path_max_queueing_delay_exceeded
    [Tags]    RG_OPT_2023    SKIPRUN
    [Documentation]
    ...  *Description:*
    ...    This user scenario describes successful call setup with FDD  TDD FR1 DL CA for the single UE with dynamic flow control,
    ...    data split over PCell and SCells, with blind SCells addition and blind SCells activation and path delay increased.
    ...    Beamforming on TDD FR1 SCells is disabled
    ...
    ...  *Preconditions:*
    ...    Used HW: gNB (ASIB, 2xABIO, AMIA), UE simulator (Airphone ASIK + 3xABIL)
    ...    Simulated RRH (AHLOA) - gNB ABIO-1 RF1, AP ABIL-1:  Cell-1 - FDD FR1 10MHz ( band n71 )
    ...    Simulated RRH (AHFIB) - gNB ABIO-1 RF7, AP ABIL-2:  Cell-2 - FDD FR1 10MHz ( band n66 ), Cell-5 - FDD FR1 10MHz ( band n25 )
    ...    Simulated RRH (AEQE)  - gNB ABIO-2 RF1, AP ABIL-3:  Cell-3 - TDD FR1 60MHz ( band n41 ), Cell-6 - TDD FR1 60MHz ( band n77 )
    ...    Simulated RRH (AHCA)  - gNB ABIO-1 RF2, AP ABIL-1:  Cell-4 - FDD FR1 10MHz ( band n5 )
    ...
    ...    Both TDD Cells are configured on the same RU so they are mapped to the same L2-RT instance!
    ...
    ...    gNB configuration:
    ...    - New L2RT architecture (CB007736) is enabled:
    ...        NRBTS/NRDU.flexibleCAMode = 2 (ConfigurationIndependent)
    ...    - Mobility support for mixed carrier aggregation (CB008015) is enabled:
    ...        NRBTS/NRDU.actConnectedModeMobilityCA = True
    ...    - All FDD cells are configured to allow SA access:
    ...        MRBTS/NRBTS/gNbCuType = SA+NSA
    ...        Each FDD Cell has configured MRBTS/NRBTS/NRCELL.cellDepType = SA
    ...    - Inter-band FDD + TDD FR1 DL CA feature (5GC002640) is activated and legacy CA features are activated too:
    ...        NRBTS/NRDU.carrierAggregationSupportList contains elements equal to 600 (ca_Fdd_Any_Sa), 200 (ca_Fdd_Fr1Tdd_Sa) and 3 (ca_Fdd_Fdd)
    ...    - CA relations are configured for each FDD cell by NRRELs pointing to:
    ...        1 FDD Cell: Cell-2 and TDD Cell: Cell-6
    ...    - SCell addition method is set to blind:
    ...        each NRREL object NRBTS/NRCELL/NRREL.sCellAdditionMethod parameter is set to 0 (blind)
    ...    - SCell activation method is set to blind:
    ...        NRBTS.sCellActivationMethod = 0 (blind)
    ...    - DRX is disabled in both FDD and TDD FR1 Cells:
    ...        NRBTS/NRCELL.actCDrx = False
    ...    - DSS features are disabled in FDD Cells:
    ...        NRBTS.actLteNrDss = False
    ...    - Aperiodic CSI is disabled in all Cells:
    ...        NRBTS.NRCELL.actAperCsi = False
    ...    - TDD Cells are configured with subframe configuration according to 5GC001116-B (TD LTE config 2 SSF6 starting from SFN 0):
    ...        frameStructureType = tdLte
    ...        guardPeriodLength = 6 symbols (SSF6)
    ...        lteToNrFrameShift = 0ms
    ...        prachConfiguration = 97 (format A2 in subframe 7)
    ...        ssBurstSetPeriod = 20ms
    ...    - TDD Cells are configured without beamforming:
    ...        NRBTS/NRCELL.actBeamforming = False
    ...    - TDD Cells are configured without 5GC002200:
    ...        NRBTS/NRCELL.dlMimoMode = 2x2 Open Loop Spatial Multiplexing
    ...    - Cell 1 has NRRELs, with sCellAdditionMethod set as blind, that point to
    ...        Cell 2: FDD (e.g. band 66),
    ...        Cell 3: TDD (e.g. band 41, choose one NRARFCN)
    ...        Cell 6: TDD (e.g. band 41, different non-contiguous NRARFCN with Cell 3)
    ...    - Cell 1, Cell 2 and Cell 6 are activated and on-air. Cell 3 is inactive.
    ...    - Long PUCCH is enabled:
    ...        NRBTS/NRCELL.pucchModeSelect = longPucch
    ...    - FDM scheduling is enabled:
    ...        NRBTS/actFdmScheduling = True
    ...        NRBTS/NRCELL.actIncreasedFdmUsersPerSlot = True
    ...    - NR-UE1 supports FDD-TDD 3CC CA with band combinations:
    ...        * CA_n66A-n71A-n77A (FDD n71 + FDD n66 + TDD n77),
    ...        * CA_n41A-n71A-n77A (FDD n71 + TDD n41 + TDD n77),
    ...        * CA_n41(2A)-n71A   (FDD n71 + TDD n41 + TDD n41),
    ...        * CA_n41C-n71A      (FDD n71 + TDD n41 + TDD n41)
    ...    - NRBTS/NRCELL/primaryPathMaxQueueingDelay = 10ms
    ...    - NRBTS/NRCELL/secondaryPathMaxQueueingDelay = 10ms

    ...  *Test Steps:*
    ...    Step 1: Blind SCells activation
    ...    Step 2: NonGBR Data transmission in both directions
    ...    Step 3: Decreasing maximum queueing delay for primary path
    ...    Step 4: Decreasing maximum queueing delay for secondary paths
    ...
    ...  *Postconditions:*
    ...    UE is configured with 3CC, all SCells remain active
    ...    UE performs periodic CSI Measurements on all carriers: PCell and SCells
    ...    gNB accepts CSI measurements via dedicated PUCCH Format3 resource from PCell and all SCell(s) on FDD PCell from the UE
    ...
    ...  *References:*
    ...    [1] CFAM for 5GC002640 - https://gates.nsn-net.net/view/00024a24#o=0
    ...
    ...  *History:*
    ...    v0.1 2021.07.23 Jakub Drabina – test case draft
    ...    v0.2 2021.09.16 Jakub Drabina – test case update, adjustment to new template
    ...    v0.3 2021.10.15 Jakub Drabina - test case update
    ...    v0.4 2021.10.19 Jakub Drabina – remove default MCS verification
    ...    v0.5 2021.11.04 Jakub Drabina – change traffic values to max possible on L1Bypass
    ...    v1.0 2021.11.09 Jakub Drabina - review done: https://collab.ext.net.nokia.com/ui#review:id=844428

    Register 3CC CA capable NR-UE1 to gNB-2 Cell-1
    Establish PDU session for NR-UE1 and wait for SCells blind activation

    Start SA traffic  ue=1  dir=dl  traffic_rate=350Mbps
    Start SA traffic  ue=1  dir=ul  traffic_rate=10Mbps
    Collect TTI Traces during 2 seconds and save to directory 3CC_blind_act_tput
    Wait 60s for throughput stable
    Verify if DL transmission is done via all 3 carriers
    Verify if UL transmission is done via PCell only
    Verify SA traffic  ue=1  dir=dl  expected_traffic=350Mbps
    Verify SA traffic  ue=1  dir=ul  expected_traffic=10Mbps
    Verify if UE performs CSI measurement reports on all carriers  phys_cells_ids=50,51,55
    Verify if CSI measurement reports are done via dedicated PUCCH format3  pcell=50  scells=51,55
    Verify CSI reports DTX ratio  phys_cells_ids=50,51,55  accepted_ratio=10

    Stop SA traffic  ue=1
    Release PDU session for NR-UE1
    Deregister NR-UE1

    Change to 0 maximum queueing delay for primary path on Cell-1
    Register 3CC CA capable NR-UE1 to gNB-2 Cell-1
    Establish PDU session for NR-UE1 and wait for SCells blind activation
    Start SA traffic  ue=1  dir=dl  traffic_rate=350Mbps
    Verify if DL transmission is done only via SCells

    Stop SA traffic  ue=1
    Release PDU session for NR-UE1
    Deregister NR-UE1
    Bring back maximum queueing delay

    Change to 0 maximum queueing delay for secondary path on Cell-2
    Register 3CC CA capable NR-UE1 to gNB-2 Cell-1
    Establish PDU session for NR-UE1 and wait for SCells blind activation
    Start SA traffic  ue=1  dir=dl  traffic_rate=350Mbps
    Verify if DL transmission is done via Cell-1 and Cell-3

    [Teardown]  Run keywords    Produce Scout Data                AND
    ...                         Stop SA traffic  ue=1             AND
    ...                         Release PDU session for NR-UE1    AND
    ...                         Deregister NR-UE1                 AND
    ...                         Bring back maximum queueing delay
